# Asset Inventory

This folder contains the asset inventory for my Home SOC Lab.

## Inventory Purpose

The inventory is used to document:

* Physical devices
* Virtual machines
* IP addresses
* MAC addresses
* Operating systems
* Device roles
* Monitoring status

